  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nRight now the Buttons to Accept, Decline, etc Invites or Friend Requests are only shown when you hover above the Notification. This looks a bit award when using it since randomly just 4 Buttons appear and also makes it harder to know what you can do with the Notification when not hovering above it.\n# Suggestion:\nAlways show the Buttons for Notifications to make the UI look less weird and to let the user know beforehand what they can do with the Notification.\n# Attachments:\nHere is a video of me showcasing the issue: https://streamable.com/diuov5",
